      "claim_id": "ground-breadth",
      "proposition": "The Court will adopt a rule categorically exempting conditions attached to immigration privileges and government benefits from Article III and Seventh Amendment jury trial requirements, rather than confining its holding to the specific administrative structure of the H-2A program."
